  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A tall stable stance beneath two broad crescent shoulder cloths, with a forked staff held outward. Her costume forms layered triangles rather than a conventional pointed wizard hat.",
    "face": "Sage-green skin, silver-gray eyes, modest tusks and dark hair braided into three thick sections. A calm upward gaze suggests listening to the weather.",
    "costume": "Storm-blue layered coat, pale wool collar, russet belt and wrapped boots. Fabric panels end above the ankles and open around the knees for movement.",
    "palette": "Storm blue #4A638D; cloud gray #CBD3DA; russet #A7664D; silver #A9B8C4.",
    "equipment": "A tall wooden staff with an open fork framing a small floating sky stone. No hanging chains that require physical simulation.",
    "signature": "Open forked staff, cloud collar and three thick braids.",
    "materials": "Wool, painted wood, oxidized silver and restrained cyan glow. Keep the sky stone\u2019s bloom local.",
    "back": "Two long triangular coat panels split around the legs, with a broad stitched cloud arc high on the back.",
    "animation": "Idle makes a small palm-up listening gesture. Basics release small storm motes. The active raises the staff slowly, draws a visible circular path, then plants it as the captured area resolves.",
    "vfx": "A thin blue circle previews the captured radius during travel, followed by several short vertical magic streaks. The ability is one damage pulse, not damage over time or stun.",
    "audio": "Low rising wind followed by a short soft thunder chord, capped to avoid overwhelming every other cue.",
    "risk": "Radius two covers a large portion of a crowded board. Effects must show the true edge and performance tests must include multiple simultaneous rings."
  },
